      "summary": "Added endpoint to get available status transitions",
      "description": "Added a new endpoint to retrieve available status transitions for a Coordination Issue based on the current user's permissions and the issue's current state. The response includes, for each status transition, the status key, display label, action label describing the transition, and whether it is the primary action for the user. It also includes a top-level actions array for additional actions (e.g., Unlink RFI when the issue is blocked).",
